    "regime_notes": "Positive in all reported regimes: 2024-2026 IC 0.068806, ICIR 0.488649; 2027-2029 IC 0.049583, ICIR 0.162696; 2030 IC 0.085681, ICIR 0.298519; 2031-2032 IC 0.033195, ICIR 0.113495. Small cross-section implies conservative uncertainty interpretation. The signal is materially correlated with an existing volume-shock reversal artifact and should be monitored for redundancy.",
